        "title": "The pie chart below shows the main reasons why students chose to study at a particular UK university in 1997 and 2007. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTt1dsAqvo39K9xIhXzlqCa4gYb\"><em><strong>The pie chart below shows the main reasons why students chose to study at a particular UK university in 1997 and 2007. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Reasons for Choosing a UK University: 1997 vs 2007</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y6JEdn3Zjo2CYkx2xdRluY0kgMe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGCndQn4WooJN3xTODjlmTCAgBe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Reasons for Choosing a UK University: 1997 vs 2007 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả 5 l&iacute; do sinh vi&ecirc;n ở một trường đại học UK lựa chọn học ở đ&acirc;y, v&agrave; sự thay đổi giữa năm 1997 v&agrave; 2007.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZuR1dhHVfoZNGlx5oxglDhmRgke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LoS3d6rsdot0OtxL5wOlmI2zgbg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Reasons for Choosing a UK University: 1997 vs 2007 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: 5 l&iacute; do ch&iacute;nh - ảnh hưởng - quyết định của sinh vi&ecirc;n - chọn 1 trường đại học UK - 1997 v&agrave; 2007.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EL0pdxEHto0LzrxeiBVlRMqCgRb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-pie\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng PIE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nu0Ndn599oeFWLxmqtmlb0lZg1g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Một số l&yacute; do trở n&ecirc;n phổ biến hơn (proximity to parental home), trong khi một số kh&aacute;c &iacute;t phổ biến đi (sports and social activities)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Anj6dtZ0EootzCxIryFl331Rgqk\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>suitable degree courses vẫn lu&ocirc;n l&agrave; l&yacute; do phổ biến nhất được đề cập ở cả hai năm</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLrHdc701owzfzxHR4Al2Nq3ggc\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"10\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"11\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"12\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</span></div>\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QezvdrjxYoqa2zxM72JlCFusgFO\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> </strong><strong>2 l&iacute; do tăng</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QezvdrjxYoqa2zxM72JlCFusgFO\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQsDdqIqFoFjV0xCor0lVc5SgZg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZMYgdtkUToIQYSxOzdcl3pW6gmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1997 của suitable degree courses</strong> (35%) - cao nhất, <strong>sau đ&oacute; m&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi sang 2007</strong> (tăng nhẹ l&ecirc;n 37%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Oomrdt1KbolxrkxcITllL0LZg6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của proximity to parental home </strong>(tăng mạnh nhất, từ 10% l&ecirc;n 22% - gấp đ&ocirc;i)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L1qFdzkw1o5EUHxM8SMlq9dcgtg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của quality of teaching</strong> (tăng nhẹ từ 15% l&ecirc;n 18%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMAGdlHtOoSFpCx9IcOlPJTJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VY8Vd8h5aobxxpxPMEPlRpFpghd\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VY8Vd8h5aobxxpxPMEPlRpFpghd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 3 l&iacute; do giảm</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VY8Vd8h5aobxxpxPMEPlRpFpghd\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQsDdqIqFoFjV0xCor0lVc5SgZg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H7FGd509DoIe6txU3gklKQxIgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của good sports and social activities</strong> (giảm mạnh nhất, từ 19% xuống 6%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NnJIdpkZvoYqfwxHcGIlvlM8gD2\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của quality of resource</strong> (giảm từ 21% xuống 17%, k&egrave;m so s&aacute;nh với proximity to home)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn n&oacute;i về tỉ lệ sinh vi&ecirc;n <strong>\"ưu ti&ecirc;n\" </strong>chọn l&iacute; do&nbsp;n&agrave;o đ&oacute;, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng những c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y47yd8exuoESOOxi5xNlCTuagSf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IKRIdccNqof3kcxEn8alk8I3gVO\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\"Starting with the reasons that <strong>grew in importance</strong>...\"</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TNFAd6xuoo5B4cx6JQKlnBv1gWd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\"Suitable degree courses <strong>was the dominant factor</strong> in both years...\"</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 592,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ECjCd9kNgo2gDDxem3llX8yqgEX\">The pie charts compare five major factors that influenced students' decisions when choosing a UK university in 1997 and 2007.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13837,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 593,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E912dXM4YoDbqcxP7k8lS5lXggc\">Overall, while some reasons such as proximity to parental home became more important over the decade, others like sports and social activities declined significantly in relevance. Throughout both years, suitable degree courses remained the most commonly cited factor.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13837,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 594,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YKg5d4JBno3AZ4xpmUHlwUy3gBc\">Starting with the reasons that grew in importance, suitable degree courses was the dominant factor in both years, accounting for 35% of responses in 1997 before rising slightly to 37% a decade later. Meanwhile, proximity to parental home saw the most dramatic increase, more than doubling from 10% to 22% over the period. Quality of teaching also experienced a modest rise, climbing from 15% to 18%, making it the third most popular reason by 2007.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13837,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 595,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUhCdDZsroQNtXxxVQ7lfKCJgJd\">As for the declining factors, the proportion of students who chose universities based on good sports and social activities fell sharply from 19% in 1997 to just 6% in 2007, representing the most significant decrease among all categories. Similarly, quality of resource, which was the second most important factor in 1997 at 21%, dropped to 17% over the same period, becoming less influential than proximity to home.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13837,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
